            <title>[IGNITE-2453] GridCacheStopSelfTest reveal NPE at GridNearTxFinishFuture for backup node is null</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-2453</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;We have to fix case with backup == null here &lt;br/&gt;
GridNearTxFinishFuture#checkBackup()&lt;br/&gt;
