                            <comment id="15121096" author="githubbot" created="Thu, 28 Jan 2016 09:31:37 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Github user asfgit closed the pull request at:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;    &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/apache/ignite/pull/427&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;https://github.com/apache/ignite/pull/427&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="15121126" author="vershov" created="Thu, 28 Jan 2016 09:49:13 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Also, we should add a specific test here for case:&lt;br/&gt;
1) One client node, one primary node, one backup node&lt;br/&gt;
2) During transaction primary node failed, code execution should reach GridNearTxFinishFuture#checkBackup at client side, but didn&apos;t obtain backup link yet.&lt;br/&gt;
3) Backup node failed&lt;br/&gt;
4) resuming of GridNearTxFinishFuture#checkBackup should cause &quot;failed commit transaction&quot; without any other errors or exceptions.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="15121227" author="vershov" created="Thu, 28 Jan 2016 10:56:08 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;This is covered by existing tests and should be covered by separated JUnit test in future.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
